===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*ahtōu}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{m|ine-pro|*oḱtṓw}}. Cognate with Old High German {{m|goh|ahto}}, Old Saxon {{m|osx|ahto}}, Old Norse {{m|non|átta}}, Gothic {{m|got|𐌰𐌷𐍄𐌰𐌿}}; and, outside the Germanic languages, with Sanskrit {{m|sa|अष्ट}}, Ancient Greek {{m|grc|ὀκτώ}}, Latin {{m|la|octo}}, Albanian {{m|sq|tetë}}, Old Irish {{m|sga|ocht}}, Old Church Slavonic {{m|cu|осмь}}.

